{
 "voice": "recorded",
 "speaker": "a real person (credit pending her confirmation)",
 "speed": null,
 "lang": "en-us",
 "style": "whisper",
 "source": "voice-evelyn/evelyn-s3-full.m4a",
 "made_by": "polish.py --style whisper on the whole recording, cut by word alignment (set/s3_cut.py)",
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "hook",
   "text": "Feel that? A shiver.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 2.88,
   "sha256": "3e1bddce07d4dafee78a1a96d7777977e7e96d116b820f62be07be7c3b5bfcf3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "change",
   "text": "Tiny sensors in your skin feel the air cool… and quietly let your brain know.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 6.8,
   "sha256": "df2842c16bf797868e5403881afe9c4b3b6b7adc630b37fba2db524a13c72fd7"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Your brain answers in two soft steps.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 3.36,
   "sha256": "086d7bd91972f4a9e51df1ec660781bab5928c8ee872c0924ff793ce26456b19"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "First, the little blood vessels near your skin narrow. Warm blood stays deeper inside you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.36,
   "sha256": "64c662f27fcff93bff14b5155067d7b2d78918a882decd665e00b2cd5729b2e1"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Then, if you're cold… your muscles begin to tremble. Not on purpose. Tiny, quick tightenings, over and over.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 10.24,
   "sha256": "785469e908fa2c54631b901be7e610261e3138c2596854fa4aeb25be9c09bee5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "They do just one thing. They make heat. A strong shiver makes several times more than your body makes at rest.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 9.76,
   "sha256": "31e0fecfea437b575a96532aa1d445473b2ee51b6308d7b3e0a0d3ce002ce75d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "And goosebumps? The same signal reaches the tiny muscle beside each hair… and lifts it upright.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 8.4,
   "sha256": "0d2faf0c2da0daccb854749947aada38367566889d4731176878cbaf8e94ce94"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "One cool breeze. Skin, nerves, vessels and muscle, all answering together. All… without asking you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 10.64,
   "sha256": "0b062df2ad81716567070f8feb3d6bba29ae5b2d3c7f7078c94a1ef4890fae7c"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "If you're feeling a little calmer, tap like and follow.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 4.88,
   "sha256": "a3cfc2c33ff8e9f4c5160cc22f7da7171d7bc6c91eb6ec98c16c31278db3141d"
  }
 ]
}